  "details": "When an tracker dies or turns off on legacy, the lower full body IK freezes and it's a lot less jarring.\n\nOn the 2.0 IK whenever a single tracker dies you go extreme yoga mode. The tracking point will swap with another or something like that. IE: Hip dies and snaps to foot or visa versa.",
